classDiagram
    note for Locker "全局 APM 锁（ADR-003）：Search 覆盖 Recover→Warn，Release 后才访问 Cloud；Cloud List 不获取；installed List 一次锁覆盖 Recover→Warn→Refresh→全部 Config reads；Install 一次锁覆盖 Recover→Warn→Refresh→Cloud→Cache→串行 Transaction；Uninstall 一次锁覆盖 Recover→Warn→Refresh→逐 Agent Config/Resolve/串行 Transaction；installed List、Install 和 Uninstall 只在成功 Release 后计算或渲染业务结果"
    class Locker {
        <<interface>>
        +Acquire() (Unlock, error)
    }
    class Unlock {
        <<interface>>
        +Release() error
    }
    class flockLocker {
        +Acquire() (Unlock, error)
    }

    flockLocker ..|> Locker
    Locker --> Unlock : returns
